==Acquisition==
Obtainable from the [[Arbitrations]] vendor in the {{Faction|Arbiters of Hexis}} room in [[Relay]]s for 20 {{Resource|Vitus Essence}}.

==Notes==
*Stacks additively with mods like {{M|Serration}} and {{M|Hornet Strike}}, as well as {{M|Holster Amp}} and {{Arcane|Arcane Arachne}}.
*If a weapon is swapped while the buff is active, duration will be refreshed.
*Triggers on manual and automatic weapon swaps.
**Manual
***Switching between guns or melee (default {{Keybind|F}})
***Quick swap by:
****holding a gun, then using a light melee attack (default {{Keybind|E}})
****holding a melee, then firing a gun (default {{Keybind|LMB}}) or aiming (default {{Keybind|RMB}})
**Automatic
***By enabling the "Auto Swap Weapon On Empty" toggle in the Keyboard/Mouse tab.
***Also triggered after a [[Mercy]] kill.
*The buff is applied at the end of the swapping animation. 
**Archwing weapons can trigger the mod, and are affected by its buff.

===Special Interactions===
{{Transclude|Arcane Arachne#Special Interactions}}
*{{A|Peacemaker}} cannot trigger Vigorous Swap, but can benefit from its buff (additive with base damage mods).
*After swapping to melee to trigger Vigorous Swap, Titania can refresh it while it's active by activating Razorwing.
*Swapping between Dex Pixia and Diwata in Razorwing does not trigger Vigorous Swap.

==Tips== 
*Use Vigorous Swap with the [[Set Mods#Synth Mod Set|Synth mod set]] so that your weapon reloads while it is holstered, thus removing downtime between weapon swaps by needing to reload. Similar effects from the Conclave mods {{m|Tactical Reload}}, {{m|Lock and Load}}, or {{m|Eject Magazine}} can be used to replace or stack with the passive reloading of the Synth mods.

==Bugs==
*The buff is not deactivated by ability weapons. It also affects any non-melee ability weapon.
*Reads as though to imply applying to all damage. Should say "Projectile Damage" instead of "Damage."

